-\paragraph{Graph legal analysis and calibration.}
-Network analysis has been used for statutory cross-references \citep{boulet2021measuring}, contract graph extraction is active \citep{dechtiar2025graphgrpolex}, and conformal ideas inspire calibrated evidence signals \citep{vovk2005algorithmic,gibbs2021adaptive}.  \samcgs{} is complementary because it assumes a record graph and focuses on risk search inside cyclic components.
+\revredreplace{MCTS and AlphaGo-style search are powerful under stable state transitions (\mbox{\citealp{silver2016mastering}}; \mbox{\citealp{kocsis2006bandit}}; \mbox{\citealp{browne2012survey}}).  Monte Carlo graph search reuses transpositions (\mbox{\citealp{childs2008transpositions}}; \mbox{\citealp{czech2021monte}}), and work on MCTS uncertainty highlights loop difficulty (\mbox{\citealp{moerland2020mcts}}).  Our method targets the remaining gap in information-preserving \scc{} handling for cyclic document regions.}{Monte Carlo graph search shares transpositions \citep{childs2008transpositions,czech2021monte}, while related analyses address loop-induced uncertainty \citep{moerland2020mcts}. ReKG-MCTS \citep{song2025rekgmcts} and Graph-MCTS \citep{liu2025graphmcts} apply MCTS to reasoning over external graph knowledge.}
